<title>HONG KONG: Leefung-Asco 9-month profit HK$68.23 mln.</title>
<headline>Leefung-Asco 9-month profit HK$68.23 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   24.1 gain    vs 8.9 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs 44.23 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    68.23 profit vs 25.26 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     457.69	 vs 475.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Leefung-Asco Printers Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 9-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Leefung-Asco Printers is a printing company.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from March 31. Comparative figures are for 12 months ended March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
